PortSystem          1.0
PortGroup           eda-github 1.0
name                eda-icall
version             1.2
revision            1
categories          cad
license             MIT
supported_archs     noarch
platforms           {darwin any}
maintainers         {icanalytica.com:degnan @bpdegnan} openmaintainer
homepage            https://github.com/bpdegnan/macportseda

description         Metaport: the full open-source sky130 EDA toolchain
long_description    Installs everything in this tree needed for SkyWater \
                    sky130 IC work: digital RTL-to-GDS (yosys, sby, iverilog, \
                    verilator, OpenSTA, openroad + the LibreLane-pinned \
                    openroad-ll, netlistsvg, sv2v, eqy, mcy), analog design and simulation \
                    (xschem, eda-ngspice, xyce, openvaf, irsim), analog \
                    characterization (eda-cace), layout and physical \
                    verification (magic, netgen-lvs, klayout, xcircuit, cvc-rv, \
                    py-gdstk), waveforms (gtkwave), the volare PDK manager, and \
                    the Skim EPS/PDF viewer. Board-level (kicad), mechanical \
                    (eda-freecad), VHDL (ghdl), EM (openEMS) and TCAD (charon) \
                    are separate.

# Metaport: nothing to fetch or build.
distfiles
use_configure       no
build {}

